{
  "hero_headline": "全球 AI 资本热潮现退潮信号，地缘冲突局势引发多国经济震荡 / Global AI Investment Cools as Geopolitical Tensions Rock Markets",
  "daily_overview": "今日科技界聚焦 AI 的落地能力与成本控制，尽管仍有创新项目涌现，但资本市场已开始审视 AI 企业的债务风险。财经领域，随着韩国等 AI 热点市场表现疲软，以及美国飓风灾害与地缘政治因素对油气供应的干预，全球宏观经济稳定性面临挑战。在时政层面，沙特机场遇袭及乌克兰局势加剧，国际关系复杂化程度进一步提升，迫使投资者和决策者重新评估风险敞口与避险策略。\n\nTech circles focus on AI execution and cost-efficiency; while innovation persists, debt risks are surfacing. Financially, weakening AI sentiment in markets like South Korea, compounded by supply disruptions from Hurricane Isaias and geopolitical friction, is challenging global stability. Politically, the attack in Riyadh and the escalation in Ukraine signify deepening international complexities, prompting a re-evaluation of risk management.",
